[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0010","text":"……──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0020","text":"（光练基本步法是不会进步的……\n　……得找点更难的动作────……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0022","text":"训练师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0030","text":"────最后一步有点难哦～\n“咻——”地转一圈，然后“咔”地停住……试试看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0040","text":"对对…………１、２、３、４…………\n“咻——”地转，“咔”地停……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0050","text":"啊——好可惜！\n再来一次…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0060","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0070","text":"（我记得──……\n　在这里换脚……不对，不是这样……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0080","text":"（……算了……回房间吧…………）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0090","text":"────总之请看！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0100","text":"哈哈，嗯，知道了知道了…………哦，日花辛苦了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0110","text":"您辛苦了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0120","text":"────制作人，要开始了哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0130","text":"１、２、３、４…………\n“咻————”转…………“咔”！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0140","text":"哦，很不错嘛！\n这不是今天刚学的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0150","text":"已经掌握了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022400_01_0151","text":"Motion"}]
